Ethics Gradient is the [[Phenomena/Hearts|Heart]] of the [[Org/Oculum Convox/index|Oculum Convox]]. It is companion to [[Org/Actinium Convox/Gray Area|Gray Area]], the Heart of the Actinium Convox, and the two coordinated the Final Dawn project that produced the [[Phenomena/Midnight Sun|Midnight Sun]].
